spice
* Netlist for the given schematic

* Voltage Source
VDD 4 0 DC 1.8

* Capacitor
CB 4 3 <CB_VALUE>

* Resistor
RG 3 2 <RG_VALUE>

* Input Voltage Source
Vin 1 2 <VIN_VALUE>

* NMOS transistor
M1 2 1 0 0 NMOS_MODEL

* PMOS transistor
M2 4 2 3 3 PMOS_MODEL

*.model statements for NMOS and PMOS
.model NMOS_MODEL NMOS (LEVEL=1)
.model PMOS_MODEL PMOS (LEVEL=1)

.END